2026-07-27T12:18:14.8640675Z i /tmp/Rtmp7Hl9V8/duckdb
2026-07-27T12:18:14.8641006Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T12:18:14.8641392Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T12:18:14.8641751Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T12:18:14.8642537Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T12:18:14.8643373Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T12:18:14.8644298Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
